      "id": "claim_2a4374d5eb2943328cc07afb834c518f",
      "statement": "The MCP `dev` script runs `node --env-file=.env --import tsx/esm --watch src/index.ts`, loading `.env`, executing the server through tsx, and watching for changes; the health endpoint is at `http://localhost:8765/health` (PORT=8765).",
