    {
      "id": "claim_c38602019e8540af9fd6361d63aaee39",
      "statement": "`npm run ingest:dump` runs `tsx src/ingest/dump.ts`, which executes the same load→preprocess→render→chunk pipeline as the live server but writes results to `${DATA_DIR}/_dump` as `.txt` rendered text and `.chunks.json` summaries (chunk id, section, approximate tokens, 200-char preview), letting extraction/chunking be verified without calling the embeddings API.",
