      "statement": "The MCP Express app exposes `GET /health` (unauthenticated, returns `{ status: \"ok\" }`) and `ALL /mcp` as the MCP endpoint; when `MCP_AUTH_TOKEN` is set, `/mcp` requires an `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header or returns 401.",
